  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project aims to provide targeted support to strengthen the protection of unaccompanied migrant children. To achieve this, the Project is structured around the following three key pillars:
1) Strengthening the capacities of national authorities to respond to the specific needs of unaccompanied migrant children
2) Supporting unaccompanied migrant children in transition to adulthood
3) Increasing awareness of rights and promoting empowerment among unaccompanied children in migration</narrative>
  </description>
